    <!-- How your data is handled -->
    <string name="pi_offline_t">Stays on your phone</string>
    <string name="pi_offline">The app has no internet permission. Android itself blocks it from connecting to anything, so your data can\'t be sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="pi_nothing_t">Nothing collected</string>
    <string name="pi_nothing">No accounts, no analytics, no ads, no tracking, no crash reports. The makers of the app never see your data.</string>
    <string name="pi_encrypted_t">Encrypted</string>
    <string name="pi_encrypted">Your data file is encrypted with AES-256. The key is kept in the phone\'s secure hardware and can\'t be copied off the phone.</string>
    <string name="pi_nobackup_t">No automatic cloud copies</string>
    <string name="pi_nobackup">Google cloud backup and phone-to-phone transfer are turned off for this app. Your data only leaves the phone in a backup file you create and protect with your own password.</string>
    <string name="pi_permissions_t">Permissions used</string>
    <string name="perm_notifications">Notifications: to show appointment reminders</string>
    <string name="perm_alarms">Alarms and reminders: so reminders ring on time</string>
    <string name="perm_boot">Run at startup: to re-arm reminders after the phone restarts</string>
    <string name="perm_biometric">Fingerprint or face: only when app lock is on. Android checks it; the app never sees your fingerprint or PIN.</string>
    <string name="pi_never_t">Never requested</string>
    <string name="pi_never">Internet, contacts, location, camera, microphone, photos and files, phone calls, text messages.</string>

    <!-- User agreement -->
    <string name="agreement_title">User Agreement</string>
    <string name="agreement_intro">Please read this before using Ultimate Sales Productivity. It\'s short, and it explains who is responsible for your data.</string>
    <string name="ag1_t">1. Your data stays with you</string>
    <string name="ag1">Everything you enter is stored only on this phone. The app has no internet access, no accounts and no servers. The makers of the app never receive, see, store or process your data.</string>
    <string name="ag2_t">2. You are solely responsible for your data</string>
    <string name="ag2">You alone are responsible for the information you enter, including your clients\' personal details, and for keeping it accurate, secure and backed up. You are responsible for following any laws, regulations and company policies that apply to the client information you store, including getting any consent they require.</string>
    <string name="ag3_t">3. Backups are your responsibility</string>
    <string name="ag3">Because nothing leaves your phone, nobody else can recover your data. If the phone is lost, stolen, damaged or reset, or the app is uninstalled, your data is gone unless you have made a backup. Back up regularly and keep your backup password safe: a forgotten password can\'t be reset or recovered by anyone.</string>
    <string name="ag4_t">4. No liability for lost data</string>
    <string name="ag4">To the fullest extent permitted by law, the makers of the app are not liable for any loss, corruption or disclosure of client data, sales records or other app data, or for any damages, lost sales, lost income or other losses arising from using or being unable to use the app, however caused.</string>
    <string name="ag5_t">5. Provided \"as is\"</string>
    <string name="ag5">The app is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\", without warranties of any kind, express or implied. Figures such as commission, rates and goal progress are calculated for your convenience; check important numbers yourself.</string>
    <string name="ag6_t">6. Security has limits</string>
    <string name="ag6">App lock, encryption and backups greatly reduce risk, but no system is perfectly secure. Keep your phone\'s screen lock turned on and its software up to date.</string>
    <string name="ag7_t">7. Changes to this agreement</string>
    <string name="ag7">If this agreement changes, the app will ask you to read and accept the new version before continuing.</string>
    <string name="ag_translation">If a translation of this agreement differs from the English version, the English version applies.</string>
    <string name="agreement_checkbox">I have read and agree to this User Agreement, and I understand that I am solely responsible for backing up my data.</string>
    <string name="agree">I agree</string>
    <string name="decline">Decline</string>
